  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 77baa01dcd2504b4baadbbe1814763ce, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: d261072bdc7e48b428f5ff1e715b6a58, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a2bfe2a562078640b9ce1b52f1c7455, type: 3}
  msgs:
  - In the year 20XX, hackers and viruses were swarming the internet more than ever
    before.
  - To keep those attacks under control, a cyber-security patrol unit was formed
    to patrol the internet and fight off hackers.
  - And it became commonplace for people to defend their data by themselves with
    the aid of their anti-virus.
  - And that's where NINJA.exe came in. A software-hardware hybrid anti-virus, that
    gives the user strength to fight viruses and hackers on the internet.
  - 'And somewhere, a kid dreamt of becoming a cyber-defender. To draw out every
    last bit of power NINJA.exe was capable of providing. '
  - This is their journey to become THE NETWORK NINJA.
  img: {fileID: 934583243}
  txt: {fileID: 1345758472}
  i: 0
  fading: 0
